= Solution
{parent=a}

Taking the complex <derivative> along the real direction gives
$$
\boxed{f'(z)=u_x+iv_x}.
$$
Taking it along the imaginary direction and equating the two expressions gives the <Cauchy-Riemann equations>
$$
\boxed{u_x=v_y,\qquad u_y=-v_x}.
$$

